{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4f849e68-74a5-599a-ba3d-6f5cf28a4938", "source_ordinal": 802, "reading_ordinal": 3255, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "导盲", "published_at": "2025-05-05T17:45:48.100000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1902424982971183724/answer/1902777957774255559"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "仔细想想，其实拒绝导盲犬的真的是全季酒店吗？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "其实真正拒绝导盲犬的是其他住客——这才是酒店管理层再三商量后仍然拒绝接受导盲犬的真正原因。", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 68}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "酒店方对这个问题并没有什么意见，真正会有意见的是住户。", "char_start": 69, "char_end": 96}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "酒店有社会压力，有法定责任，但住户却没有。住户可以无视社会规范，任意惩罚不顺己意的酒店——哪怕酒店方仅仅是履行法定的社会责任。", "char_start": 97, "char_end": 160}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "而酒店方预计住户的惩罚比社会的追责造成的损失更大，所以两害相权取其轻了。", "char_start": 161, "char_end": 197}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "社会舆论骂一骂，但是这个舆论背后其实没有多少真实的能量。", "char_start": 198, "char_end": 226}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "主管部门批评批评，但这种批评没有罚款依据，只不过皮痛肉不痛。", "char_start": 227, "char_end": 257}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "盲人本身感到不满，酒店可以直接私下里稍作赔偿——双倍房费、帮你转介到旗下其他更高级的酒店、帮你打车送行，这个代价甚微。", "char_start": 258, "char_end": 317}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "比冒险让客户看到狗后打差评对酒店的伤害小。", "char_start": 318, "char_end": 339}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "看到问题没有？", "char_start": 340, "char_end": 347}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "社会法则做出修改，要得到自然法则的追认，这中间是有很多工作要做、要有相当的历史进程的。", "char_start": 348, "char_end": 391}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这不是一个“言出法随”的过程。", "char_start": 392, "char_end": 407}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "并非将某件事设定为违法，这件事就会自动绝迹——某些情况下不但不绝迹，甚至都不会减弱，有些甚至还会得到反向增强。", "char_start": 408, "char_end": 463}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这也是为什么尽管法律已经赋予了女性、少数民族、弱势群体平等的人格地位，并不等于社会平等的事业就已经完成了。既有的社会格局和既得利益者们还有大量的实际影响力来抑制、延缓甚至取消这些社会变革的进程。", "char_start": 464, "char_end": 561}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "ta们甚至并不一定需要主动的作为——就像酒店并不需要给住客打电话就会主动把赌注押在“不如拒绝导盲犬”一边一样。", "char_start": 562, "char_end": 617}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "微妙的是——酒店未必不乐见事态如此发展。因为事态如此发酵一下，酒店就可以顺理成章的导入这条明文规定。", "char_start": 618, "char_end": 668}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "下次有住户抗议，酒店就可以拿出这件“惨痛教训”来解释“并非我不想顾及各位的体验，奈何我会被处罚”，从而消解住户的抵触情绪。", "char_start": 669, "char_end": 730}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这就像在某些地区，某些餐厅也并不完全抗拒因为客人抽烟被罚一点小款一样。", "char_start": 731, "char_end": 766}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "没被罚，自己主动的限制客人吸烟，餐厅就会遭受经营损失；被罚了几千块，就可以拿出罚款单来诉苦——“不是我不迁就，奈何有教训”。", "char_start": 767, "char_end": 829}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "其实餐厅自己早就不想迁就这些烟客，但就必须这样走一道程序。", "char_start": 830, "char_end": 859}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这就是所谓的“相当的历史进程”。", "char_start": 860, "char_end": 876}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "认识到社会法和自然法两者之间复杂的协调关系，提前猜到哪里有多大的差距、这差距有多硬、是趋增还是趋减、是否会走向消亡、何时会消亡，这是人的社会性发育的重要内容。", "char_start": 878, "char_end": 957}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这也是人有效挖掘财富的源泉、管理风险的起点。", "char_start": 958, "char_end": 980}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "看一个社会新闻，愚人总是急于愤怒和欣喜，而在愤怒和欣喜的冲动发泄完毕后就转向下一个愤怒和欣喜的刺激。理解不但不被视为必要的工作，还常被这类人视为软弱。", "char_start": 981, "char_end": 1056}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "聪明人则会在放纵情绪之前先关注理解，迭代自己的认知，寻求更深入的掌握社会这事物的习性。久而久之，后者和前者的人生轨迹自然会拉开差距。", "char_start": 1057, "char_end": 1123}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "理解不是一种软弱，而是一种征服。", "char_start": 1124, "char_end": 1140}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 27}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0469"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：视障人士携带导盲犬入住全季酒店被拒，酒店的行为违法吗？暴露出哪些问题？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026"], "summary": "围绕“导盲”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“仔细想想，其实拒绝导盲犬的真的是全季酒店吗？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "仔细想想，其实拒绝导盲犬的真的是全季酒店吗？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "54fe56ba-2280-5a0d-9022-7cd8ee6695ab", "source_ordinal": 801, "reading_ordinal": 3256, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "去赤字生活", "published_at": "2025-05-06T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/d8582196244211f0b5ff52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "除非遇上什么天灾人祸，不借钱就过不下去，或者真有什么高度可靠的投资机会，否则负债一向都是不可取的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 49}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "而所谓“高度可靠的投资机会”，基本必然和时代的潮水相伴，是国运级别的大涨潮，属于“就算你弄错了，也只是晚一些回本、赚得了多少”的行情，这个你不会看不见的，所以这个撇开不谈。", "char_start": 50, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这里谈的是“举债过奢华的生活”。", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 153}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这个是真的不可取的，因为债务利息是一项远超一般人预期的心理负担。", "char_start": 154, "char_end": 186}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "收入不能压制利息的规模，只能付息，不能还本，人就会精神上感到加倍的疲惫。", "char_start": 187, "char_end": 223}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "利息支出开始出现无法压制的增长，即需要不断的借新债来维持生活水平，人就会陷入越来越深的焦虑。而且既然这趋势已成，", "char_start": 224, "char_end": 280}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "一旦进入到“收入无法支付利息”的境地，人的心理就会陷入巨大的绝望和冒险投机情绪之中。一旦陷入这个境地，对普通人而言就迈过了一条真正的红线，因为自身的人格身份已经被债务事实上变成了不值得保留的东西，人容易爆发种种反社会的冲动——例如想要通过走私、赌博、绑架、勒索、诈骗等等手段翻身。", "char_start": 281, "char_end": 421}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而更糟糕的是——运气好一次失败去坐牢了反而是最好的结果，如果运气不好，真的得手了、“翻身”了，几乎没人会珍惜这得之不易的第二次机会，而是绝大多数都会觉得“这也不失为一种可行之道”。", "char_start": 422, "char_end": 512}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "要往累犯、惯犯方向发育。", "char_start": 513, "char_end": 525}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "不到万劫不复，再也不会回头。", "char_start": 526, "char_end": 540}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "不要和嘲笑“诚实的清贫”的人为伍，也不要和那些拜金的人结交，不要把审视你、评判你的权柄放在这些人手里。", "char_start": 541, "char_end": 592}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "青少年之所以会染上这类债务毒瘾，追根到底是因为这些人的凌辱、蹂躏，把原本完全可以自持的生活沾染了耻辱感、低贱感。", "char_start": 593, "char_end": 649}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "要解决这些人的影响，不要用恨和憎恶，而要用“怜悯”。", "char_start": 650, "char_end": 676}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "是的，你要学会可怜ta们。", "char_start": 677, "char_end": 690}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "因为这些人是真的可怜。", "char_start": 691, "char_end": 702}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "锦衣玉食，食不果腹；夜夜笙歌，睡不安枕。", "char_start": 703, "char_end": 723}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "看似狂欢不止，其实是亢奋难宁。", "char_start": 724, "char_end": 739}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这是现代社会，有瓦遮头、有食饱腹，然后每月都有结余，这是人心极大的安慰。", "char_start": 740, "char_end": 776}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "不要去愁什么“将来父母病了怎么办”“子女上学怎么办”——事实上我国最基本的教育保障、医疗保障绝不至于让你到“病无所医”“毫无出头之日”的地步。", "char_start": 777, "char_end": 848}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "良心干净，随遇而安，生老病死，人间常事，不要以这些为借口去举债享乐——那样招来的债务地狱的折磨远远胜过你幻想的“病了看不起”和“孩子没好书读”。", "char_start": 849, "char_end": 921}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "投资不是不可以，一定要和你的劳动技能、信誉积累有实打实的联结。", "char_start": 922, "char_end": 953}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "按照这个原则，等你真有足够的知识、人脉可以支撑投资时，你靠的不会是举债，而是靠融资了。", "char_start": 954, "char_end": 997}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "因此，在青年时代不要举债，要坚持无赤字生活。", "char_start": 998, "char_end": 1020}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "略有积蓄，如果有超出六个月应急金的部分，可以不断的投资在自己的技能和经验上。", "char_start": 1021, "char_end": 1059}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0469"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎么看待张朝阳再次强调年轻人不要负债?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024"], "summary": "围绕“去赤字生活”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“除非遇上什么天灾人祸，不借钱就过不下去，或者真有什么高度可靠的投资机会，否则负债一向都是不可取的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "除非遇上什么天灾人祸，不借钱就过不下去，或者真有什么高度可靠的投资机会，否则负债一向都是不可取的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 49, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a0e27107-e09d-5e06-9e88-f771897586ce", "source_ordinal": 800, "reading_ordinal": 3257, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "哈利不识字", "published_at": "2025-05-07T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/e90959f8252611f084df52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "美国的识字率问题比中国严重很多。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "因为英文和中文相比存在一个特殊的劣势——日常生活用语和学术专业术语之间存在巨大的鸿沟。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 60}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "举点例子——", "char_start": 61, "char_end": 67}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "医学用语几乎全系都是希腊语。", "char_start": 68, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "化学专属词汇几乎全系拉丁语。", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 97}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "法律、工程、机械、生物、数学……几乎任何本科以上的专业领域都会涉及到大量很难从日常英语加以猜测的专有词汇。", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 151}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "举点好笑的例子，中文叫“温度计”，温度+计=温度计。", "char_start": 152, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "英语“温度”是temperature。", "char_start": 179, "char_end": 198}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "“温度计”呢？是thermometer。", "char_start": 199, "char_end": 219}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "英文“关节”，joint。", "char_start": 220, "char_end": 233}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "英文“关节炎”，arthritis。", "char_start": 234, "char_end": 252}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "中文“等差数列”，望文生义。", "char_start": 253, "char_end": 267}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "英文“Arithmetic sequence”，来自古希腊语。", "char_start": 268, "char_end": 299}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "一个人从日常英语的角度哪怕不算是一个文盲，ta要纯凭日常英语的经验去意会专业术语的难度也要远超一个中国人纯凭日常中文经验去意会中文的专业术语。", "char_start": 301, "char_end": 372}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "如果这个人的日常英语都可称文盲，那么这个人将连趴在学术的墙头向里张望一下的机会都没有。", "char_start": 373, "char_end": 416}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "而哪怕一个不会写字的中国人，恐怕都可以毫不费力的意会“温度计”“关节炎”大概是什么。看学术文献连猜带蒙也可以猜个七七八八。", "char_start": 417, "char_end": 478}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这也解释了中国民科和美国民科的巨大风格差异——中国民科常常构建与现行科学架构平行的私有术语空间，最大的问题是把已经解决的问题换一套名字重新表述一遍，误以为是新发现——很多还真的自己独立重新造了一遍轮子。", "char_start": 479, "char_end": 580}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "而美国的“民科”呢？则往往是在主张“地球是个圆盘”“日心说是骗局”这类离谱得多的东西。", "char_start": 581, "char_end": 624}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这个要害就在于英语对无基础自学的障碍极大，导致美国的民间学术爱好者连“像模像样”的“形似”都做不到。", "char_start": 625, "char_end": 675}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "明白了这一点，再看美国的“识字率危机”，足以让你不寒而栗。", "char_start": 676, "char_end": 705}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "本来英文在从基础教育升格至学术教育时就有相对中文的天然的劣势，现在还搞得连日常英文都有读写障碍。这意味着哪怕中国识字率也只有79%，美国的问题也要严重得多。", "char_start": 706, "char_end": 784}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "何况中国的识字率远不止79%。", "char_start": 785, "char_end": 800}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 23}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0469"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待美国识字率只有79％？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022"], "summary": "围绕“哈利不识字”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“美国的识字率问题比中国严重很多。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "美国的识字率问题比中国严重很多。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8713b342-19eb-54c9-a52b-798beed0b77c", "source_ordinal": 799, "reading_ordinal": 3258, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "暗天使", "published_at": "2025-05-07T23:44:56.618000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1903426089042289238/answer/1903596108636197941"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "两个角度。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "从义愤的旁观者角度：", "char_start": 6, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你发现有人在恶意骚扰无辜的人，你自己有义愤，你可以准备一个“干净的账号”，即与你要保护、帮助的人完全没有任何联系、也和你自己的真实身份没有反向联系的账号，对施暴者发动反制。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 103}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "如何反制呢？", "char_start": 104, "char_end": 110}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "就是通过这个账号向这个人发送以下警告信息——", "char_start": 111, "char_end": 133}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "1）我注意到了你的这个行为，我认为这个行为不正当。", "char_start": 134, "char_end": 159}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "后面附上我所看到的事态，描述一下我对这件事的见证和观察。", "char_start": 160, "char_end": 188}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "免得你对事情的性质发生误判。", "char_start": 189, "char_end": 203}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "2）我会关注事态的发展。如果这个情况继续恶化，我会介入。后面附上关于“情况恶化”的具体定义。", "char_start": 205, "char_end": 251}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "明确告知——你现在还不必疑神疑鬼，第一我不会用任何违法的手段，第二如果我正式决定介入，我会明确通知你。", "char_start": 252, "char_end": 303}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这类人一般精神比较脆弱，上天有好生之德，留下改过的机会。", "char_start": 304, "char_end": 332}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "3）我劝告你停止现在的行为。下面给出“停止作为”的标准定义——这不但是指停止这个做法，还指公开表态会停止这个做法。", "char_start": 334, "char_end": 391}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "出路明确的告诉了你，你要避免这份威慑的压力，你就照办就行，其实轻而易举。", "char_start": 392, "char_end": 428}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "人在做，天在看，不要认为这个世界没有人在乎正义。", "char_start": 430, "char_end": 454}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "发送完就把这个人拉黑，拒收ta的消息。", "char_start": 455, "char_end": 474}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "完全脱离接触，不要跟这人纠缠。", "char_start": 475, "char_end": 490}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这些人自带邪气，缠上来很烦人，不要给ta们机会放毒。", "char_start": 491, "char_end": 517}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "分析一下这种策略的有效性原理。", "char_start": 519, "char_end": 534}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "事实上你什么动作都没有做，也没有产生任何可追究的法律责任。", "char_start": 535, "char_end": 564}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "但是如果有多个这样的路人对这个人发出了这种无法反击的严正警告，就会对这个人产生巨大的震慑作用。", "char_start": 565, "char_end": 612}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "ta会幻想你是受到受害人指使的，但ta第一没有能力查证，第二拿去向受害人发泄，会发现受害人根本不知道你的存在。", "char_start": 613, "char_end": 668}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你是纯纯的暗天使。", "char_start": 669, "char_end": 678}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "而你要做这件事需要多大的成本呢？一封邮件、一个评论、一封私信而已。", "char_start": 679, "char_end": 712}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你的风险呢？", "char_start": 713, "char_end": 719}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你在完全的暗处，ta要反制你要付出巨大的成本。光是找到你就难如登天，而就算ta付出了这个成本，找到了你，ta要反制你什么？", "char_start": 720, "char_end": 781}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "你甚至可以举起双手“你真厉害，你找到我了，那我道个歉吧，我不介入了”，从这事情里脱身而去。ta能怎样？", "char_start": 782, "char_end": 833}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "你甚至可能根本都不在国内。", "char_start": 834, "char_end": 847}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "如果ta受到了七八个、上十个这样的警告呢？", "char_start": 848, "char_end": 869}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "ta反制你一个又如何？还有六七个、十来个。一个一个的去追溯这些黑暗守护者的身份，一个一个的去反制、恐吓？", "char_start": 870, "char_end": 922}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "既然无法对抗全部，单独的反制一个并无实际意义——反制了这一个，真能对其他守护者起到吓阻作用吗？", "char_start": 923, "char_end": 970}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "看到了吗？在成群的“义愤路人”面前，这种恶人就是一个可怜虫。而讽刺的是，ta无能为力的原因恰恰和受害人无能为力的原因完全相同。", "char_start": 972, "char_end": 1035}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "再从当事人自身的角度：", "char_start": 1037, "char_end": 1048}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "这样的义愤路人既然对方根本无从查证，查证了也无可奈何，那么你自己当然也可以做自己的义愤路人。", "char_start": 1049, "char_end": 1095}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "你的父母、兄弟、朋友、同学当然也可以当义愤路人。", "char_start": 1096, "char_end": 1120}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "ta们缺注册用的闲置手机号、邮箱号吗？", "char_start": 1121, "char_end": 1140}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "这里面注意好那几个关键：", "char_start": 1142, "char_end": 1154}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "1）规定清楚你反对的行为是什么，不要制造无边的恐惧。", "char_start": 1155, "char_end": 1181}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "2）宣告清楚动手会明确预告，不要制造无端的恐惧。", "char_start": 1182, "char_end": 1206}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "3）清晰的告知不会使用非法手段，不要形成邪恶的恐惧。", "char_start": 1207, "char_end": 1233}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "你严守这些准则，那么对方只要不违法乱纪，其实没有什么可困扰的。对方自己心里有鬼，自然会产生相应的压力。", "char_start": 1234, "char_end": 1285}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "这些守护者不必对这人亮明自己和受害人之间的关联。", "char_start": 1286, "char_end": 1310}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "因为亮明这些关联反而会对对方造成额外的安全感——ta会更进一步的相信“除了这人的亲戚朋友，没人会去帮助受害者”。", "char_start": 1311, "char_end": 1367}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "真正震慑邪恶的是无亲无故，但愿意拔刀相助的路人。", "char_start": 1368, "char_end": 1392}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "因为对手的亲戚朋友都有迹可循，有办法预防和周旋。", "char_start": 1393, "char_end": 1417}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "但纯路人永远在暗，永远不会穷尽。无法预防、也无法经济的反制。", "char_start": 1418, "char_end": 1448}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "纯路人被ta的行径激怒到会警告ta，对这些宵小是绝对无力对抗的社会压力。", "char_start": 1449, "char_end": 1485}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "记住——以路人的身份公开发声，本身就是威力巨大的帮助。", "char_start": 1486, "char_end": 1513}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "再凶恶的黑社会，一旦旁观群众纷纷站起来说一句“我看不过眼”，一旦站出来的人数够多，这些恶人也要卷起尾巴跑路。", "char_start": 1514, "char_end": 1568}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "站不出来，无非顾虑报复，那么就采取手段从数学上扼杀报复的经济性。", "char_start": 1569, "char_end": 1601}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "看懂没有？", "char_start": 1603, "char_end": 1608}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "方法的原理放在这里，如果你在哪里看到这类令人发指的暴行，自己的良知有负担，又纠结自己没有好的方法介入，可以参考。", "char_start": 1609, "char_end": 1665}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "不必照抄，自己思考、自己行动、自己负责。", "char_start": 1666, "char_end": 1686}, {"paragraph_id": "P053", "field": "body", "index": 53, "text": "有必要的话，请先咨询专业律师，确保不与任何法律规范发生抵触。", "char_start": 1687, "char_end": 1717}, {"paragraph_id": "P054", "field": "body", "index": 54, "text": "另外，记住，", "char_start": 1719, "char_end": 1725}, {"paragraph_id": "P055", "field": "body", "index": 55, "text": "这的确是扶危济困的利器，但是还是要提醒你们——佳兵不祥，圣人不得已而用之。", "char_start": 1726, "char_end": 1763}, {"paragraph_id": "P056", "field": "body", "index": 56, "text": "我并不鼓励任何人轻易的使用这方法，先确认你有足够的“不得已”。", "char_start": 1764, "char_end": 1795}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 67}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0469"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：长期被开盒骚扰，报警和起诉都尝试过但对方依然没有停止，该怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052", "P053", "P054", "P055", "P056"], "summary": "围绕“暗天使”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“两个角度。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "两个角度。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "71a5466f-85af-5311-8e17-21f0a1e678b4", "source_ordinal": 798, "reading_ordinal": 3259, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "荫蔽", "published_at": "2025-05-08T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/f73ab2f025fe11f0bfab52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "将来你们之中也有人会功成名就、大权在握，这是必然的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "那时候你也可能有荫蔽子孙的想法，而且也会有相当的能力这么做。", "char_start": 27, "char_end": 57}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这个时候你就要注意下面这个话——给予子孙的帮助，不要超过ta们的实力。", "char_start": 58, "char_end": 93}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这道理很简单——如果ta只有一个班长的水平，你非要把ta托举到团长，实际上ta驾驭不住，反而是害了ta。", "char_start": 94, "char_end": 146}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "但这不是问题的重点。", "char_start": 147, "char_end": 157}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "问题的重点在于——你怎么知道ta的实力到底是多少？", "char_start": 158, "char_end": 183}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "“我这么成功的人，怎么可能还不了解我自己的子女。”", "char_start": 184, "char_end": 209}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你是想这么说吗？", "char_start": 210, "char_end": 218}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你要是这么想，你家必遭大难。", "char_start": 219, "char_end": 233}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "为什么？", "char_start": 234, "char_end": 238}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "因为首先你这个认定本身就狂妄至极，而这份狂妄必然会遭致子女的痛恨，埋下ta们以自毁作报复的隐患。你觉得ta行，ta不行也行？你觉得ta不行，ta行也不行？就因为你是教授？是高官？", "char_start": 239, "char_end": 328}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "就算你是皇帝、是爱因斯坦又如何？皇帝和爱因斯坦就能算准自己的子女如何了？", "char_start": 329, "char_end": 365}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "只要你有这种“我的子女我还能看不准”的念头，你直接就可以给自己两拳，先醒醒脑子——就这一个念头，你已经自居为神了。凡人自居为神，必然人见人憎，不会有好结果的。", "char_start": 366, "char_end": 445}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "而这还不是这么做最凶险的所在。", "char_start": 446, "char_end": 461}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "更凶险的是，一旦你直接下了这判断，而你又有荫蔽子孙的动念，你极有可能动用你的钱财势力，耍弄手段去安排你的设想成真。", "char_start": 462, "char_end": 519}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你决定要给子女安排一个专家，你就会动用势力去安排这种履历。", "char_start": 520, "char_end": 549}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "而这个安排，一定涉及到徇私舞弊。", "char_start": 550, "char_end": 566}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "而这是极端的大忌。", "char_start": 567, "char_end": 576}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "为什么呢？", "char_start": 577, "char_end": 582}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "很多世家始祖都会误解世家积累优势的实质运行逻辑。", "char_start": 583, "char_end": 607}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "ta们是这么想的——我先积累名望、财富、权势，例如先攒个1000。然后我如果被抓住了什么不良的行为，大不了也就扣个300、500，我家业豪富、人脉深广，就算出现这么点挫折也不会伤筋动骨。", "char_start": 608, "char_end": 701}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "简而言之，不懂行的始祖们很容易误以为凭着自己的积累，自己有一定的“承罪力”。", "char_start": 702, "char_end": 740}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这是完全算错了公式。", "char_start": 741, "char_end": 751}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "事实上真正会落地的逻辑，是你余额1000，犯了个-20的罪，得到的结果会是 ( 1000 - 20 ) x ( -1 ) = -980 !", "char_start": 752, "char_end": 821}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "是-980！ 看明白了吗？", "char_start": 822, "char_end": 835}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "为什么？", "char_start": 836, "char_end": 840}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "因为通过你的这番操作，公众会意识到你这混账会把你1000点的积累全部视为反社会的本钱，社会不但不应该接受你这1000的积累存在什么交换价值，反而会认为你的积累越大，对社会威胁越大。", "char_start": 841, "char_end": 931}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "你要是小户人家，也许还可以网开一面。", "char_start": 932, "char_end": 950}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "尤其你是世家大族、根深叶茂，你家出现这种公然违反社会法则、挑战社会基本价值的行为，别说是杀人越货、欺男霸女，就算是作弊、行贿、走后门，只要被抓住，你家的一切权、钱、名的积累，就不只是扣除一份损失而已，其余额还要打上一个负号。", "char_start": 951, "char_end": 1063}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "本来的确是可以让子孙十世无忧的资源，一夜之间要变成致命的祸根。", "char_start": 1064, "char_end": 1095}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "你作为始祖，如果在这一点基本常识上无知，你哪里荫蔽了什么子孙，你甚至还不如留给ta们一个贫寒清白的家世来的有福。", "char_start": 1096, "char_end": 1152}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "如果你看明白了这种“罚完取负”的自然法则，你就可以想想作为世家始祖，钱、权、名都不匮乏的前提下，应该怎么荫蔽子孙。", "char_start": 1153, "char_end": 1210}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "答案是你可以无限的为ta们创造机会，例如无限次的支持ta们创业、考学、申请公职、艺术创作……但绝不要把一分一厘的金钱权势用在帮ta们作弊上。", "char_start": 1211, "char_end": 1281}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "你做生意，我给你本钱、可以合法取得的信息、知识，你做去，能做多大做多大，能成就成，不成可以再做，但我绝不伸手帮你买通什么监管，或者帮你搞定什么内幕消息。", "char_start": 1282, "char_end": 1358}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "你要搞艺术，可以，凡是钱能请到的名师我都可以给你请，但是我绝不帮你收买一个艺术评论家给你“塑造形象”，也决不串通什么画廊来帮你抬高身价。", "char_start": 1359, "char_end": 1427}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "因为只要我们家族不被公众视为敌人、视为威胁社会规则的邪恶要素，一般的亏损、失败，在我们雄厚的财力和积累面前只不过是扑向巨石的小小浪花。", "char_start": 1428, "char_end": 1495}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "我作为始祖，我也不敢自居知道你们到底是什么材料、有何实力，我信奉的是“神裁”——你公平的考，能考到几级，你就是几级的实力；你公平的去战斗，能打到什么军衔，就是什么军衔的水平。你的实力带你到什么地方，那个地方和你名实相符，我就不担心我把本无才能的你捧到了你驾驭不住的高度反而害了你；也不担心我低估了你的才能，耽误了你。", "char_start": 1496, "char_end": 1654}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "家里的财富权势，不是拿来给你们作弊用的，只能严格的用于给你们争取更多的参与公平竞争的机会，仅此而已。", "char_start": 1655, "char_end": 1705}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "然而恰恰是这样，我们的家族才能不断的躲过“突然被视为社会公敌而被摧毁”的厄运。", "char_start": 1706, "char_end": 1745}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "在整个社会面前，再强大的家族权势也只不过是蝼蚁而已，这根本没有悬念可言。任何认不清这种基本事实、心存侥幸、妄念的家族都是不可能撑过百年的。", "char_start": 1746, "char_end": 1815}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "以我始祖的人望武功，积累下这份高耸入云的家财名望，你们只要不犯这种自居为神、挑衅社会基本价值的蠢行，就算个人能力再差，也有希望熬到几代之中出现人才，熬到家道中兴、传承不断。", "char_start": 1816, "char_end": 1902}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "尤其是，以我家的财雄势大，我们的族人却代代谨慎，只有愚蠢无能的，但却没有利用这份资源为非作歹、徇私舞弊、行贿枉法的，仅凭这份“有所不为”，我们的传承就有一份金钱难买的运势保底。", "char_start": 1903, "char_end": 1991}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "这才是世代不绝、能沉淀出举世无双的尊贵价值的要害。", "char_start": 1992, "char_end": 2017}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "这才是对子孙的荫蔽、爱护，而不是毒害。", "char_start": 2018, "char_end": 2037}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "你们中必有新家族的始祖，记住这些话，绝不能忘。", "char_start": 2038, "char_end": 2061}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "忘了是会毁家灭族的。", "char_start": 2062, "char_end": 2072}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 46}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0469"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：董袭莹被指毕业于哥大巴纳德学院，不符合协和「4+4」招生要求，她的升学路径反映出哪些问题？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046"], "summary": "围绕“荫蔽”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“将来你们之中也有人会功成名就、大权在握，这是必然的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "将来你们之中也有人会功成名就、大权在握，这是必然的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e635b0d2-6c74-590b-a392-885e1514a14d", "source_ordinal": 797, "reading_ordinal": 3260, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "全勤奖", "published_at": "2025-05-09T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/537359ce268011f0a93652540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这个问题其实是一个数学问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "所谓“努力”，其根本效应是在普遍亏损的阶段使亏损额低于平均值，而在普遍盈利的阶段使盈利高于平均值。", "char_start": 15, "char_end": 64}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "也就是无论随机结果如何，努力都可以在这个结果上额外追加一笔来自努力的收益。", "char_start": 65, "char_end": 102}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "我们就假定你的努力就只能+10。", "char_start": 103, "char_end": 119}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "运气呢？那波动就很大了，时而-50，时而正80。", "char_start": 120, "char_end": 144}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "而你本身有100的存量。", "char_start": 145, "char_end": 157}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "游戏规则是这样的——因为自然选择数百万年的作用，你的基本构造是基本和你所降生的自然和社会环境相适应的。这从数学上表达，意思就是你生下来的时候如果算有100本金的话，你所降生的这个自然环境最恶劣的状态也很少能达到-100，甚至连-50都不到。因为如果到达-100，则意味着你这个平均初生儿本钱100的种族会普遍亏损到0，出现新生儿断代而成年人也死亡几成的极端濒危现象，这样你这个种族早就被自然淘汰了。", "char_start": 158, "char_end": 357}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "所以，你的出生本金100，与你相匹配的自然与社会环境的涨落也就是+-50左右。", "char_start": 358, "char_end": 397}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "而你的努力呢？能让你在+50的时候拿到+55，-50的时候拿到-45。", "char_start": 398, "char_end": 433}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "很多人感叹努力不如运气重要，是在感叹当运气是-50的时候，凭努力不能拿到0以上的正收益，看懂了没有？", "char_start": 434, "char_end": 484}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "ta们在感叹-50的时候，自己努了力，还是损失了-45，还是巨额亏损——毕竟按照丰年、平年、灾年概率均等来算，这一个-45就是ta们9年才能积攒的血汗。", "char_start": 485, "char_end": 561}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "看懂这个心态怎么来的吧？——辛辛苦苦10年，运气不好，一夜之间回到原点。", "char_start": 562, "char_end": 598}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "反过来呢？", "char_start": 599, "char_end": 604}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "如果遇到一个丰年，基数直接+50，就算自己躺着不动，也有+50。而就算是很努力，也不过+55而已。躺着不动也有十年的累计利润从天上掉下来，努力争那+5有何意义？", "char_start": 605, "char_end": 685}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这一正一反的数字摆在眼前，只需要一年级的数学水平都会产生“努力不如运气”的结论。", "char_start": 686, "char_end": 726}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "但这个忘记了几个要害：", "char_start": 727, "char_end": 738}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "躺平甚至空耗会极大的增加破产率。", "char_start": 739, "char_end": 755}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "有这么一个游戏：给你10块钱本钱，猜硬币，每次下注5块，猜中了加倍，猜错了没收，游戏不能终止，无限持续。", "char_start": 756, "char_end": 808}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "请问：既然机会均等，是否你可以无限玩下去？", "char_start": 809, "char_end": 830}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "答案是不能。", "char_start": 831, "char_end": 837}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "因为你一定会在某个倒霉的阶段押错致命的一注，然后破产退出游戏。", "char_start": 838, "char_end": 869}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这个游戏只会有这一种结果，区别仅仅在于这个情况何时发生而已。也许你能撑到800万次，但迟早，这种“百年一遇的连续倒霉”是要发生的。", "char_start": 870, "char_end": 935}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "同样的逻辑，如果你完全躺平，即不通过努力对结果做任何正向修正，那么在最倒霉的情况下，连续两个灾年就能让你亏损到0，被踢出游戏。", "char_start": 936, "char_end": 999}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "但是那些努力的人呢？", "char_start": 1000, "char_end": 1010}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "ta们会因为还有10点剩余，有机会看到下一局的结果。", "char_start": 1011, "char_end": 1037}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "这才是努力的决定性作用——它可以作为概率天平上的一根稻草，大大的降低你被扫地出局的概率、显著地延长你的实际寿命。", "char_start": 1038, "char_end": 1094}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "它不是用来“战胜运气”用的，而是为了帮你多争取几次抽奖机会用的。", "char_start": 1095, "char_end": 1127}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "它是除不尽的那个3、约不掉的那0.6。", "char_start": 1128, "char_end": 1147}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "就这三根手指头，挂在了悬崖边上，人家掉下去了，你没掉下去。", "char_start": 1148, "char_end": 1177}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "你吊着一口气，过了最凶险的“连续三年大旱”这个坎，后面就可以追加三十多集剧情——后面三十多年都没再出现过这么极端的天气了。", "char_start": 1178, "char_end": 1239}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "它是不是比运气更重要，这见仁见智，但它肯定是很重要的，这确定无疑。", "char_start": 1240, "char_end": 1273}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "注意上述计算并没有计入积极努力所触发的社会正反馈——天道是不是酬勤，这也许还有点争议，但是人道绝对是酬勤的。", "char_start": 1274, "char_end": 1328}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "算上这份“国补”，这福利还不够多吗？", "char_start": 1329, "char_end": 1347}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 33}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0469"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：人的这一生，运气真的比努力重要吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033"], "summary": "围绕“全勤奖”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这个问题其实是一个数学问题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这个问题其实是一个数学问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "86fe6de6-1351-5937-9b51-bfba5d68f8d1", "source_ordinal": 796, "reading_ordinal": 3261, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "before trial", "published_at": "2025-05-09T23:44:37.036000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/15254583616/answer/1904232769053259422"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "美国的律师行业有一个基本守则——“don‘t go to trial”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "啥意思呢？", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 42}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "一个案件要进入法庭审讯阶段，先要经过大陪审团检视证据（刑事）决定是否起诉，再看被告认不认罪（一般伴有辩诉交易 plea deal），进入庭讯之后还有机会争取无效审判（mistrial）。", "char_start": 43, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "而所谓no trial是指要尽可能的阻止案件进展到由陪审团讨论、法官裁定的环节，争取在这个阶段之前就靠无效化或者控辩交易结案。", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 200}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "因为一旦进入审判阶段，结果谁也没有把握。", "char_start": 201, "char_end": 221}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "不仅是无法预料陪审团——这是一群非法律专业的平民——会得出什么结论，而且谁也料不到法官到底会怎么判。法官出于个人偏好重判或者轻判的案例比比皆是。", "char_start": 222, "char_end": 294}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "在这之前，律师还可以靠自己和检察官打交道的经验为客户争取尽可能好的条件；一旦进入审判环节，那就失去掌控了，出了什么难以接受的结果，要纠正成本也很高了。", "char_start": 295, "char_end": 370}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "上诉法院的司法成本是很贵的，而且客户也未必掏得起二审的律师费用。而且不管是美国还是中国，除非你真的发现什么重大的瑕疵、提交什么新的决定性证据，否则二审推翻一审结论的概率极低。", "char_start": 371, "char_end": 458}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "大家都不傻——老是推翻，分一二审的意义就几乎不存在了。谁都要二审，还要一审干嘛？", "char_start": 459, "char_end": 499}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这个思路在中国也有同类，就是“生不入官门”。", "char_start": 500, "char_end": 522}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "有矛盾、有纠纷，最好达成协议直接和解，不到万不得已，不要走司法审判程序。", "char_start": 523, "char_end": 559}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "双方都觉得自己有理，但你觉得自己万分有理和司法审判会给的结果之间并没有强相关关系。", "char_start": 560, "char_end": 601}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "无论你觉得自己多把握十足，你都可能会输。", "char_start": 602, "char_end": 622}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "注意，这不是在指控司法机关营私舞弊、贪赃枉法，而是指由人组成的审判机关天生就是这么个属性，这根本没有办法解决。", "char_start": 623, "char_end": 678}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "没有这个认知的人只要进入司法程序，从另一头出来的时候有很大概率骂骂咧咧、要大叫“贪赃枉法”。", "char_start": 679, "char_end": 725}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "骂完了还是一样。", "char_start": 726, "char_end": 734}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "司法机关只能做到这个水平，因为司法就是这么难。", "char_start": 735, "char_end": 758}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这么说吧，有一天人类发明了AI法官，AI法官来判，你重复提交两次，AI给出来的判决都可能不一样。", "char_start": 759, "char_end": 807}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "何况是人？", "char_start": 808, "char_end": 813}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "不要对司法给出你自己不认同的结果过于惊讶。也不要对一些挂着律师牌的人对司法结果的攻击过于在意。", "char_start": 814, "char_end": 861}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "律师站的那个立场不是法官的立场，实际上受的训练是非常不同的，利益取向也有巨大的差异。ta们不赞同这个那个判决属于正常现象——ta们自己还不是一样经常打输官司？", "char_start": 862, "char_end": 941}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "辩诉、审判是有巨大的不确定性的过程，你最好把问题拦截在这个过程之前就解决掉。", "char_start": 942, "char_end": 980}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "一旦进入这个过程，你就要做好“不知道会出什么判决”的准备。", "char_start": 981, "char_end": 1010}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "不管你觉得自己多占理，这对你都是赌博，都有输的概率。", "char_start": 1011, "char_end": 1037}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "事情只能是这样，而且坦率说，永远会是这样。", "char_start": 1038, "char_end": 1059}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "多多学习能在进入司法程序之前就解决问题的策略和技能，确保万一有什么纠纷突破了这些策略进入审判环节你自己的赢面尽可能的大一些，这就是你能追求的最好的法律态度。", "char_start": 1060, "char_end": 1138}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "绝不要“恃法而骄”。", "char_start": 1139, "char_end": 1149}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "其实每当司法有一些边缘性争议的时候就会出现大量激烈的争论，本质上讲就是有人指着“恃法而骄”然后发现司法实践有点脱离ta的预期搞得ta骄不起来于是产生了应激反应。", "char_start": 1150, "char_end": 1230}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "这本来就是一个错误的活法，应该改掉这个错误的活法，而不是任由自己陷入对灰色问题的无穷纠缠之中。", "char_start": 1231, "char_end": 1278}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "你要保险，索性灰色的都不碰，而不是弄得一身灰然后逼着人承认“我这还算够白”。", "char_start": 1279, "char_end": 1317}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "关键网友说你白没用。", "char_start": 1318, "char_end": 1328}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 31}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0469"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：法院判错案子后，为什么改判过程会如此困难呢？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031"], "summary": "围绕“before trial”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“美国的律师行业有一个基本守则——“don‘t go to trial”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "美国的律师行业有一个基本守则——“don‘t go to trial”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
